# Axiom footprints of the roots (ROOTS.txt) and of the test theorems (namespace EraseProof.Test).
# One line per declaration: <declaration> <axioms> <sorry labels>
#   <axioms>: its `#print axioms`, comma-separated in the order propext, Classical.choice,
#             Quot.sound, sorryAx; `-` for none.
#   <sorry labels>: the lean4lean `sorry` declarations it reaches (L1-L8, see
#             tools/Report.lean `sorryLabels`), comma-separated; `-` for none.
# proof/scripts/check.sh compares this file with the computed .check/axioms.actual.
EraseProof.ProgEnv.lookup propext,Classical.choice,Quot.sound -
EraseProof.ProgEnv.ordered propext,Classical.choice,Quot.sound -
EraseProof.ProgEnv.unfold propext,Classical.choice,Quot.sound -
EraseProof.ProgEnv.wf propext,Classical.choice,Quot.sound,sorryAx L1,L2
EraseProof.TrS.defeqDFC propext,Quot.sound,sorryAx L1,L2,L3,L4,L5
EraseProof.TrS.det propext -
EraseProof.TrS.fvarsIn propext,Classical.choice,Quot.sound -
EraseProof.TrS.inst propext,Classical.choice,Quot.sound -
EraseProof.TrS.inst_let propext,Classical.choice,Quot.sound -
EraseProof.TrS.weakFV propext,Classical.choice,Quot.sound -
